Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 23:44:16 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 06/18] feat(core): harness plugin target

Plugin inventory, manifest directory and harness resolution know the
Coding Harness distribution. Plugin composition emits each persona's task
agent twin into .harness-aidlc/host/agents (tier projected to
thinkingLevel from the installed tier table, no model pin, spawns: [] for
non-spawning agents), checks stage dispatch against that roster, and
projects method references to the default space. Harness plugins use the
current-root inventory like OpenCode.
